Error [E0911]: `drop` isn't a migration verb — use `remove`
  --> tests/ui/migration_unknown_op.jet:7:5
    |
  7 |     drop x
    |     ^^^^
 Why: A migration deletes a field with `remove`; `drop` is not a Jet keyword here
 Fix: Write `remove <field>` to delete a published field
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0911
